WEBVTT

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.385
Well done.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.893
I really can't believe
he just awakened.

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.801
Are you all right?

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:52.634
Yeah, it is nothing.

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:56.665
But it really
drains you, doesn't it?

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.142
You'll get used to it soon.

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:01.305
Oh my.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.474
I just can't watch.

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:06.110
But I wonder what's up with her.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.847
Why was she
so against this, and yet...

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:10.378
Maybe she got
used to the idea...

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.687
...that all we can do
is go forward.

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:18.328
This is your... office?

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.730
Is there something
not to your liking?

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:24.259
No, not at all.

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:26.238
It's just a little unusual.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.638
This is just temporary.

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:31.508
We don't have
any particular office.

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:34.513
We don't officially exist,
after all.

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:40.084
I see... I understand.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.747
That was Number Twelve.

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:45.257
It had grown quite a bit.

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:47.987
It's not just Number Twelve
that's grown.

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:50.052
Compared to how big it was at first,
the gate in Machida...

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.394
...has grown more
than twice as much.

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:57.567
Um, Inspector Ibuki?

00:03:58.605 --> 00:04:02.336
What were you trying to say
to me back then?

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:06.873
There's one more thing
I need to tell you.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:07.902
It's vital.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.111
It's all right.

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:14.711
At this point,
nothing will surprise me.

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:16.980
You've made up your mind.
Good.

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:20.153
I said this at first as well,

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:22.684
but the reason
we're fighting the phantoms...

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:26.756
...is to obtain the 108 parts
they possess.

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:29.233
And when we're able to bring
all of them together,

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:31.567
the Box of Druj
will take shape...

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.936
...and we will be able
to close the gate.

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:38.137
In other words, we'll be able
to lock them away in Hell again.

00:04:38.177 --> 00:04:41.772
But unfortunately, we've only
obtained 14 parts,

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:45.250
including the ones we obtained
today from Number Twelve.

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:46.684
Then the remaining ones...

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:49.688
We're assuming
that there isn't anyone else...

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:54.284
...that have gotten their hands
on the other 94 parts, but...

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:58.024
There are other symbionts.

00:04:58.064 --> 00:05:00.225
We know of two others.

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:03.997
But they have yet
to make contact with us.

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:06.699
And we still don't know
if they're on our side or not.

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:10.971
Either way, our fight
has just begun, right?

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.944
There's no time.

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:16.745
Even now, the gate
is definitely growing.

00:05:16.783 --> 00:05:19.479
Until it swallows up
the whole world.

00:05:19.519 --> 00:05:22.488
I understand.

00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:23.853
I'm not finished yet.

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.050
What?

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:26.888
I'm getting to the main point now.

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:31.954
Shindo... No. From now on,
I'll be calling you Ranmaru.

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.989
And you can call me Ryouko.

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:35.933
R-Right.

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:37.765
We're counting on you,
Ranmaru!

00:05:37.804 --> 00:05:39.294
Right.

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:41.500
Ranmaru, listen carefully.

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:44.772
The 108 parts aren't just inside
of their bodies.

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:49.442
She means that they exist
inside of us symbionts, too.

00:05:51.217 --> 00:05:53.981
You understand
what that means, right?

00:05:58.624 --> 00:06:02.355
Jeez... is she telling me
we have to kill each other?

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.662
Hey now, don't push yourself!

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:08.667
It's all right, I tell you.

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:12.432
But isn't it a bit early for you
to check out of the hospital?

00:06:12.472 --> 00:06:14.030
I told you...

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:17.099
...I'm being protected
by someone, so I'll be fine.

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:22.645
More importantly, you need
to be careful, big brother.

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:25.116
You're being threatened
by some strange people, right?

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:33.217
For some reason, it feels like
you're different, big brother.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.349
Really?

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:38.922
It seems like you're a bit more
intense or something.

00:06:38.965 --> 00:06:41.297
Maybe it's my imagination.

00:06:41.334 --> 00:06:43.894
I honestly have never
wanted you...

00:06:43.936 --> 00:06:46.234
...to get revenge for us,
big brother.

00:06:46.272 --> 00:06:49.241
Saya...

00:06:49.275 --> 00:06:54.838
I'd be happy if you just lived
a normal life.

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:05.556
Hey, Shindo,
what's with that outfit?

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:07.218
Yeah, you see...

00:07:09.395 --> 00:07:10.384
Hey!

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.795
C-Chief!

00:07:11.831 --> 00:07:13.992
Jeez, what the hell is going on?

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:15.432
W-Well...

00:07:15.468 --> 00:07:19.336
Don't just "well" me!
What the hell is with that outfit!?

00:07:19.372 --> 00:07:21.203
You see, I was ordered to...

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.367
Ordered, you say?

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:26.674
I see, I see.
Do you mean because of this?

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:29.442
Hey! What the hell is this!?

00:07:29.482 --> 00:07:32.713
Er, it's an order to transfer
to the second division.

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:34.947
I know that.

00:07:34.987 --> 00:07:36.386
The problem is
what the order says!

00:07:36.422 --> 00:07:39.687
"Starting today, Ranmaru Shindo
of the S.M.I. F...

00:07:39.725 --> 00:07:42.125
"...is being transferred
to the second division.

00:07:42.161 --> 00:07:44.652
"Further, his position and post...

00:07:44.697 --> 00:07:46.892
"...will continue to be
in the first division as before.

00:07:46.933 --> 00:07:50.130
However, he will not be limited
to its chain of command."

00:07:50.803 --> 00:07:52.862
What the hell
is that supposed to mean!?

00:07:52.905 --> 00:07:54.270
W-Who knows?

00:07:54.307 --> 00:07:57.003
In short, Shindo will still be
stationed here...

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:59.102
...and his position
will remain with us...

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:03.172
...but he'll be acting
under the orders of the Tokko.

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:04.945
Fine by me!

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:06.918
In other words,
he'll be eating here,

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:08.284
but he doesn't have to listen
to my orders!

00:08:08.321 --> 00:08:12.849
E-Even if you say that,
it's not my fault!

00:08:12.892 --> 00:08:15.656
That bitch!

00:08:15.695 --> 00:08:19.529
This time I really can't
forgive her!

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:24.291
What?

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:27.773
U-Umm, where are
the drinks and such?

00:08:27.807 --> 00:08:28.796
Over there.

00:08:30.877 --> 00:08:32.435
Want me to go buy you one?

00:08:32.478 --> 00:08:35.572
N-No, it's not like
I want one right now.

00:08:37.483 --> 00:08:38.541
Feeling regrets?

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:39.573
Huh?

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:41.553
Sakura will be back soon, so...

00:08:41.587 --> 00:08:42.713
What?

00:08:42.755 --> 00:08:44.586
She's going to see Hiroki today.

00:08:44.624 --> 00:08:46.751
What are you saying?

00:08:46.792 --> 00:08:48.657
You're still feeling shy?

00:08:48.694 --> 00:08:50.355
Hey now...

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:53.126
It's all right.
You're young after all.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.891
By the way,
where's Inspector Ibuki?

00:08:56.936 --> 00:08:58.301
Ryouko?

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:01.238
She said that she had an important
meeting with the higher-ups.

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:05.037
What kind of people
are they exactly?

00:09:05.077 --> 00:09:06.271
Could it be that she's also...

00:09:06.312 --> 00:09:10.112
Ryouko's a normal person,
unlike us.

00:09:10.149 --> 00:09:11.446
Even still...

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:12.473
She has guts.

00:09:12.518 --> 00:09:13.507
Yes.

00:09:13.553 --> 00:09:16.613
A lot of things have happened
to Ryouko, too.

00:09:19.559 --> 00:09:24.189
You're Inspector Ryouko Ibuki
from the Tokko, correct?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.458
Yes.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:28.990
You know why you've been
called here, right?

00:09:29.035 --> 00:09:33.836
I apologize for disobeying orders
and awakening Ranmaru Shindo.

00:09:33.873 --> 00:09:35.864
First, tell us why.

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:37.773
This was something
that couldn't be helped.

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:44.112
As you know, ever since the gate
in Machida opened five years ago...

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:48.314
...we, the Tokko, have been
dealing with the phantoms...

00:09:48.354 --> 00:09:50.879
...and have provided
reliable results.

00:09:50.923 --> 00:09:55.553
But recently, with the frighteningly
rapid expansion of the gate...

00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:57.790
...and the increase
in the number of phantoms...

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:01.596
...we had no choice but to rely on
awakening Ranmaru Shindo.

00:10:01.634 --> 00:10:06.731
But because of your actions,
a terrible situation has come to pass.

00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:08.603
You understand that, right?

00:10:08.641 --> 00:10:10.871
I understand that very well.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:12.741
They're angry!

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:15.246
Exactly how are you planning
on dealing with this?

00:10:16.248 --> 00:10:18.216
Council Leader, I request
that disciplinary actions...

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.774
...be taken against
Inspector Ibuki!

00:10:19.819 --> 00:10:22.447
I would like to propose
that Inspector Ibuki's punishment...

00:10:22.488 --> 00:10:25.423
...fit the magnitude of her crime.

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:28.188
If we do that, then they might
hold to the agreement.

00:10:28.227 --> 00:10:31.355
Ridiculous, they can't be trusted
to keep an agreement!

00:10:31.397 --> 00:10:33.592
But what other recourse
do we have?

00:10:33.633 --> 00:10:34.930
It's hopeless
no matter what we do!

00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:36.298
Silence!

00:10:36.335 --> 00:10:38.530
I'm going to be frank.

00:10:38.571 --> 00:10:44.009
There are those among us who wish
to coexist with the phantoms...

00:10:44.043 --> 00:10:45.567
...but that is nonsense!

00:10:45.611 --> 00:10:46.600
Hey!

00:10:46.646 --> 00:10:49.774
I believe that when it comes
to the phantoms...

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:52.943
...we must maintain a firm stance,
no matter what the situation!

00:10:52.985 --> 00:10:55.419
Are you saying this is diplomacy,
Inspector Ibuki?

00:10:56.722 --> 00:10:58.986
We don't have that kind
of leeway!

00:10:59.025 --> 00:11:01.585
No! This is not diplomacy!

00:11:01.627 --> 00:11:02.787
This is war!

00:11:18.911 --> 00:11:20.037
Hiroki!

00:11:45.137 --> 00:11:46.161
Hiroki...

00:12:46.665 --> 00:12:47.654
Yes?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.689
It's me.

00:12:48.734 --> 00:12:50.258
Councilor Ogata?

00:12:50.302 --> 00:12:52.668
That was quite
an impression you made.

00:12:52.705 --> 00:12:54.036
Thank you very much.

00:12:54.073 --> 00:12:56.337
Thanks to that,
we've got more enemies.

00:12:56.375 --> 00:12:57.933
I'm sorry.

00:12:57.977 --> 00:12:59.968
But I was able to arrange it...

00:13:00.012 --> 00:13:01.843
...so that we were able
to get around punishing you.

00:13:01.881 --> 00:13:04.213
I am grateful for all the trouble
that you've gone through.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.946
Even still, thanks to what
you said...

00:13:06.986 --> 00:13:09.546
...it sounded like there are
agents working for the phantoms...

00:13:09.588 --> 00:13:10.850
...in the inner circle.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.824
We cannot say
that the possibility is not there.

00:13:12.858 --> 00:13:14.883
It seems like there is
a leak somewhere...

00:13:14.927 --> 00:13:17.225
...informing them
about our current activities.

00:13:17.263 --> 00:13:18.855
In that case, be careful.

00:13:18.898 --> 00:13:21.128
From here on,
you may be targeted.

00:13:21.167 --> 00:13:22.862
I understand.

00:13:22.902 --> 00:13:23.994
Inspector Ibuki.

00:13:24.036 --> 00:13:25.025
Yes?

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.665
If you're thinking about revenge,
then stop.

00:13:28.707 --> 00:13:30.504
Personal feelings will lead you
to make mistakes.

00:13:30.543 --> 00:13:33.034
I appreciate the warning.

00:13:33.078 --> 00:13:38.106
But I am not so green as to let
my emotions affect my actions.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.913
So you say.

00:13:39.952 --> 00:13:42.182
If you've that much energy,
then I'm sure things will be fine.

00:13:42.221 --> 00:13:44.485
Thank you very much.

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:47.515
I'm really sorry about
what happened to him.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:48.754
It's all right.

00:13:48.794 --> 00:13:50.762
It was work, after all,

00:13:50.796 --> 00:13:54.732
and I'm able to carry on
and do the same job.

00:13:54.767 --> 00:13:57.600
Hearing you say that is a relief.

00:13:57.636 --> 00:13:59.866
Just in case,
I'm providing a guard.

00:13:59.905 --> 00:14:01.372
I'll contact you again later.

00:14:11.884 --> 00:14:15.479
Man, I'm hungry.
Where do you want to eat today?

00:14:15.521 --> 00:14:18.615
Hey, what're things
like at the Tokko?

00:14:18.657 --> 00:14:23.026
Again with that?
I'm telling you I really don't know.

00:14:23.062 --> 00:14:24.256
They don't even have an office.

00:14:24.296 --> 00:14:25.320
Jeez.

00:14:25.364 --> 00:14:27.958
Even still, you're having
a grand old time...

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.524
...surrounded by all of those
beautiful women, right?

00:14:29.568 --> 00:14:33.504
Seriously, man, you know what kind
of stuff they do there, right?

00:14:33.539 --> 00:14:34.699
Even still...

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.173
Mr. Shindo!

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:37.573
Huh?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.441
Is it all right if I eat lunch
with you?

00:14:39.478 --> 00:14:41.036
S-Sure.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.014
You're more than welcome to.

00:14:43.048 --> 00:14:44.276
It suits you.

00:14:44.316 --> 00:14:46.307
Huh? Oh, this?

00:14:46.352 --> 00:14:48.047
Do you have a sword
or anything?

00:14:48.087 --> 00:14:49.952
I-I don't have anything like that.

00:14:49.989 --> 00:14:54.756
By the way, Mr. Shindo,
how is Saya doing?

00:14:54.793 --> 00:14:57.887
Oh, she should be able
to work pretty soon.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:03.163
Um, would it be all right
if I came by your house tonight?

00:15:04.036 --> 00:15:08.302
Oh, it would be to check in
on Saya, of course.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.673
And I want to see
your room, too.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.178
W-What are you talking about?

00:15:25.691 --> 00:15:26.680
Are you all right?

00:15:26.725 --> 00:15:28.716
Yeah, it's just a scratch.

00:15:28.761 --> 00:15:30.729
That car's license plate!

00:15:30.763 --> 00:15:34.324
There's no mistaking it.
That's the car that went after Saya!

00:15:35.267 --> 00:15:37.030
Damn it, they're messing
with me!

00:15:37.069 --> 00:15:39.128
Hey! Wait, that's a car
you're going after.

00:15:39.171 --> 00:15:41.435
I don't care that it went after me.

00:15:41.473 --> 00:15:43.600
But I can't forgive anyone
that lays a hand on Saya!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.143
Shindo, get in, quick!

00:15:46.178 --> 00:15:48.009
Mr. Muramasa!?

00:15:49.748 --> 00:15:51.238
I'm going to floor it!

00:16:05.331 --> 00:16:07.925
Mr. Muramasa, why are
we taking a side road?

00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:08.991
I'm anticipating
where they're going!

00:16:20.746 --> 00:16:25.183
It looks like we've lost sight
of them, Mr. Muramasa.

00:16:25.217 --> 00:16:26.206
Yeah.

00:16:26.251 --> 00:16:28.446
Who in the world are they?

00:16:30.756 --> 00:16:33.657
What's the matter?
You don't look so good.

00:16:33.692 --> 00:16:35.819
It's nothing.

00:17:24.143 --> 00:17:25.804
Is this supposed to be
a warning?

00:17:25.844 --> 00:17:28.039
Or is it for real?

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:33.218
It would seem that it's for real.

00:17:56.175 --> 00:17:57.904
Please hold on tight!

00:17:57.943 --> 00:17:59.103
Ranmaru!?

00:18:09.188 --> 00:18:12.180
Jeez, what disgusting guys!

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:13.623
What in the world are you
planning on doing?

00:18:23.268 --> 00:18:24.292
What power he has!

00:18:28.874 --> 00:18:31.399
There should be
a main body somewhere.

00:18:31.443 --> 00:18:34.708
It'll be difficult to find
without an ion detection device!

00:18:44.089 --> 00:18:45.215
Over there, huh?

00:18:46.358 --> 00:18:50.192
It can't be... could it be
he knows where they are?

00:19:27.499 --> 00:19:28.761
Jeez.

00:19:33.272 --> 00:19:36.105
Enough already!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:45.981
I can't believe it.

00:20:03.435 --> 00:20:04.424
Are you all right?

00:20:05.704 --> 00:20:07.103
Somehow.

00:20:07.139 --> 00:20:09.835
Even still, he's incredible.

00:20:09.875 --> 00:20:11.308
You saw?

00:20:11.343 --> 00:20:12.332
Yeah.

00:20:12.377 --> 00:20:14.811
Without saving me?

00:20:14.846 --> 00:20:16.040
Did you need it?

00:20:19.184 --> 00:20:23.052
How did you know
that I was attacked?

00:20:23.088 --> 00:20:24.350
I didn't call it in.

00:20:24.389 --> 00:20:28.120
That is... I don't really know.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:32.324
When I chased the car that came
after me, I started feeling bad.

00:20:32.364 --> 00:20:33.592
What?

00:20:33.632 --> 00:20:35.827
Afterwards, it sounded
like something...

00:20:35.867 --> 00:20:37.892
...was calling to me
and I came here.

00:20:37.936 --> 00:20:39.130
Called?

00:20:39.171 --> 00:20:40.399
Hmm.

00:20:40.439 --> 00:20:42.873
In any case, by the time
I realized it, I was there.

00:20:44.576 --> 00:20:48.376
This is the first time
I've seen a symbiont like you.

00:20:51.883 --> 00:20:54.511
Ryouko, you're bleeding!

00:20:54.553 --> 00:20:56.418
I'm all right. This is nothing.

00:20:56.455 --> 00:20:58.946
You're a normal human,

00:20:58.991 --> 00:21:01.152
so you have to be sure
to get that taken care of.

00:21:01.193 --> 00:21:04.356
If you're careless, you'll end up
like your predecessor.

00:21:05.197 --> 00:21:06.789
Predecessor?

00:21:06.832 --> 00:21:10.962
Right, the investigator assigned
to the Anti-Phantom Committee,

00:21:11.003 --> 00:21:13.665
which was the forerunner
to the Tokko and Ryouko's...

00:21:13.705 --> 00:21:16.173
Kureha, that's enough of that.

00:21:16.208 --> 00:21:18.176
I'm sorry, did I upset you?

00:21:19.745 --> 00:21:21.975
That's right.

00:21:22.014 --> 00:21:26.849
If I had met these people sooner,
then he might not have died.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.984
When the incident
in Machida happened,

00:21:31.023 --> 00:21:34.789
he and I were both investigators
for the Security Section.

00:21:34.826 --> 00:21:37.761
At that point,
there was no Tokko...

00:21:37.796 --> 00:21:39.661
...and the S.M.I.F.
Wasn't even formed yet.

00:21:54.012 --> 00:21:59.575
Since then, my only goal
has been to kill phantoms.

00:21:59.618 --> 00:22:00.607
And...

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.514
I couldn't believe it.

00:22:04.556 --> 00:22:08.458
Since then,
I've decided what it is I must do.

00:22:08.493 --> 00:22:11.724
Find people with
the same abilities as this girl...

00:22:11.763 --> 00:22:15.563
...and make sure
to exterminate the phantoms.

00:22:17.369 --> 00:22:18.893
It's all right.

00:22:18.937 --> 00:22:22.805
The beginning of the real fight
is starting now.

00:22:41.593 --> 00:22:46.496
I held that hand

00:22:46.531 --> 00:22:51.332
And we kissed

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:56.171
After a little while

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.111
It will quietly become
our final day

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.574
Please, no matter what,
never forget

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.220
Sherry, far away

00:23:11.256 --> 00:23:13.656
Sherry, it was with you

00:23:13.692 --> 00:23:18.595
That I laughed

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:20.996
Sherry, far away

00:23:21.032 --> 00:23:23.432
Sherry, it was you

00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:28.098
That I held

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.472
I sung the memories

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:32.977
Forever melodies

00:23:33.011 --> 00:23:35.241
I sung the memories

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:40.315
I sung the memories

00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:42.843
Forever melodies

00:23:42.888 --> 00:23:45.083
I sung the memories

00:23:48.026 --> 00:23:50.358
Sherry, far away

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:52.897
Sherry, far away

00:23:52.931 --> 00:23:59.860
I know you can find
my melodies

00:24:00.939 --> 00:24:03.775
Next Episode Preview

00:24:03.775 --> 00:24:05.868
Next Episode Preview
Believe in the future.

00:24:07.179 --> 00:24:09.739
Rokujo, kill me, quickly!

00:24:10.782 --> 00:24:11.771
It's dangerous!

00:24:13.351 --> 00:24:15.285
I'll go inside of Shindo.

00:24:17.789 --> 00:24:20.019
On the next episode of Tokko:

00:24:22.327 --> 00:24:23.316
Trembling.

